  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To mobilise marginalised minority communities, with a particular emphasis on women, to defend their rights in support of the development of an inclusive and democratic Myanmar, with a focus on access and control over natural resources and women&apos;s leadership and political participation Outcome 3.1: Targeted marginalised women meaningfully participate in  informal and formal decision-making structures at local, regional and national levels Objective 3: Increasing proportion of women  participating in target informal and formal decision-making structures at local, regional and national levels</narrative>
